id: script-hold-zoom
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: jihad-script-hold.html (its script holds the engine 600 ms in every 700): pinch and pan — the page follows the finger at the new zoom without waiting for the script, the fixed header right at rest
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-script-hold.html
kit: cavekit-gpu-rendering.md R3
calibrate 'sel:#header'
pinch 384 500 150 400
wait zoom 10
expect zoom-min 1.3
drag 480 900 480 400
expect card-scroll-min 200
pinch 384 500 400 150
wait zoom 10
pinch 384 500 400 150
wait zoom 10
expect zoom 1.0 0.2
